  "title": "AI and Technology Growth in India Amid Economic Expansion",
  "summary": "India's government has approved a ₹10,000 crore SME Growth Fund, supported by IT and technology investments. A ₹526.25 crore IT and tech project in Andhra Pradesh will create over 9,000 jobs and boost economic growth, while Tamil Nadu's government secured significant investment and job creation in its regions.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The Indian government has approved a ₹10,000 crore SME Growth Fund to support businesses in manufacturing and technology.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Andhra Pradesh's State Investment Promotion Board (SIPB) cleared 10 major IT projects worth ₹526.25 crore, creating over 9,000 jobs.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Tamil Nadu's government secured ₹67,542 crore investment through 97 MoUs, with a focus on infrastructure and job creation.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
